elated services, and training and advisory services related to occupational safety and health. In addition, it develops the Integrated Sustainable Palm Oil Complex (ISPOC), which includes a palm oil mill, specialty refinery, renewable energy power plant, kernel crushing plant, and animal feed mill. Johor Plantations Berhad was formerly known as Mahamurni Plantations Sdn Bhd and changed its name to Johor Plantations Group Berhad in February 2023. The company was incorporated in 1978 and is headquartered in Johor Bahru, Malaysia. Johor Plantations Group Berhad operates as a subsidiary of Kulim (Malaysia) Berhad.","zh":"Johor Plantations Group Berhad 是一家马来西亚公司，成立于1978年，总部位于柔佛新山，主要从事棕榈油和棕榈仁的生产。公司是 Kulim (Malaysia) Berhad 的子公司，业务涵盖上游、中游、下游以及贸易与服务板块。","lines":["上游业务：生产棕榈油和棕榈仁。","中游业务：通过综合可持续棕榈油综合体（ISPOC）进行棕榈油加工和精炼，包括棕榈油厂、特种精炼厂、可再生能源电厂、棕榈仁压榨厂和动物饲料厂。","下游业务：生产可再生生物甲烷气体等可再生能源。","贸易与服务：交易农业机械及种植园所需零件，提供种子及相关服务，以及职业安全与健康培训和咨询服务。"],"lines_en":["Upstream: Production of palm oil and palm kernels.","Midstream: Palm oil processing and refining through the Integrated Sustainable Palm Oil Complex (ISPOC), including a palm oil mill, specialty refinery, renewable energy power plant, kernel crushing plant, and animal feed mill.","Downstream: Production of renewable energy, principally biomethane gas.","Trading and Services: Trading of agricultural machinery and parts for plantation needs, provision of seeds and related services, and training and advisory services related to occupational safety and health."]}}